     },
     "langs": [
      "en"
     ],
     "text": "\"[W]e all live in an Nvidia-state. What you need to know about living in an Nvidia-state is that it is not a democracy . . . the Nvidia-state governs via the logic of a hostage situation. You have two choices: Let AI rip while tech leaders act with impunity, or watch the economy enter a recession.\""
